ALBUKHR Staking Contract V2 — Runtime Bridge
Prepared for MuhmdBuharisaeed/albukhr-app.
Files:
staking.js → replace js/staking.js
project.js → replace js/project.js
Runtime behavior:
Reads published Mainnet staking terms from public.get_public_core_staking_terms_v2.
Requires the project to be ACTIVE.
Enforces exact published duration/min/max values in the browser before Pi payment begins.
Sends term_version_id and contract_version: v2 as payment metadata.
Keeps the existing API-authoritative payment approval/completion path.
Does not change the ALBUKHR 1% fee policy.
Does not activate projects or publish terms automatically.
Does not use LocalStorage.
Important: The database create_stake_from_completed_payment() remains the final authority and independently selects the published V2 term.
